# Credentials. NOTHING in here is ever committed.
#
# The sentinel creds file grants no permissions on its own (its own JWT denies pub and sub
# on `>`), but it is still a credential, and a Zitadel service-account key is a private key.
# Neither belongs in a repository that is meant to be public.
#
# .local/ is the one place local credentials go. A single ignored directory beats a dozen
# per-pattern rules and the hope that every future file matches one of them.
.local/
*.creds
*.creds.local
tokens.json
.tokens.json
*-su.json
*.pem
*.key

# Build output
dist/
*.tgz

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Test and tooling output
coverage/
*.log
.eslintcache

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
